# Production build.
#
# Left as a relative path on purpose: `vercel.json` rewrites /api to the real API host, so
# the browser only ever talks to the Vercel domain and the session cookie stays first-party.
#
# Only change this to a full URL (https://api.example.com/api) if you deliberately want the
# browser to call the API cross-origin — that needs server changes too. DEPLOY.md §B.
VITE_API_BASE=/api
